          "system__conversation_history": "{\"x-elevenlabs-history\": true, \"entries\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Hi. My order shows delivered yesterday evening, but I never got anything. Nobody came.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[sad] I am really sorry to hear that. I can see order [slow] K R T nine one five zero three three four seven [/slow] for wireless earbuds worth three thousand four hundred ninety-nine rupees was marked delivered yesterday. I will raise an investigation ticket right away to look into this with Delhivery.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"It's K R T nine one five zero three three four seven, the earbuds.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Yes, that is the one. I have raised ticket [slow] I N V four zero five one two [/slow] for this delivery dispute. Delhivery will verify this within forty-eight hours, by Wednesday seven October evening, and once done, you can choose a full refund or a replacement.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Look, I just want my refund today. Can you process it right now?\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[sad] I understand your frustration, but I cannot process a refund before the investigation is completed. Once Delhivery verifies this by Wednesday evening, we will immediately initiate your full refund or send a replacement.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Then give me the delivery guy's phone number. I'll call him myself.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"I cannot share the delivery executive's personal phone number due to privacy policies. However, Delhivery's team will contact you directly if they need any details during the investigation.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Fine. What's the complaint number, and when will I hear back?\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Your ticket number is [slow] I N V four zero five one two [/slow]. You will hear back within forty-eight hours, by Wednesday seven October evening. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Okay, bye.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Thank you for calling Kartly. Have a good day and take care. Goodbye!\"}]}",
